eryday performance.<\/p>","button_label":"See Collection","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/core-balance","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"rich_text_yRAXGG":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_NnQBbX":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Balance & Movement"}},"text_xB8nQN":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>Build stability, coordination, and control with tools designed to enhance balance and movement skills.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_NnQBbX","text_xB8nQN"],"custom_css":[],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.rich_text.name","settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"text_columns_fwJfLf":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"text_block_hf78Mk":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/J50-Balance-MoonHopper-800x1000px_2c1fae19-062a-441c-942e-8365461e110e.jpg","image_width":350,"title":"Moon Hopper","text":"<p>Improve balance and lower-body strength with this sturdy balance trainer. Features a 7\" vinyl ball in a 15\" ABS ring with burst-proof construction for safety. Supports users up to 200 lbs.<\/p>","button_label":"Shop Now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/moon-hopper"}},"text_block_4pPhcn":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/HB65-Hop-Ball-Green-800x1000px.jpg","image_width":350,"title":"Economy Hop Balls","text":"<p>Durable PVC hop balls with two grab handles, perfect for schools and recreational play. Phthalate- and lead-free, supporting up to 200 lbs. Available in 45cm, 55cm, and 65cm.<\/p>","button_label":"Shop Now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/economy-hop-balls"}},"text_block_9ipmMz":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/PCACS-Catch-A-Cup-Set_f9226a14-863f-4388-acb7-75a0c18b021b.jpg","image_width":300,"title":"Catch A Cup Set","text":"<p>Build hand-eye coordination and motor skills with this beginner-friendly cup and ball set. Perfect for indoor or outdoor play and skill development.<\/p>","button_label":"Shop Now","button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/toys?variant=40556680347777"}},"text_block_MQ9bdF":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/PES6SET_EggAndSpoonSet-Web_800x1000px_80cb5498-fce0-4b94-8b86-80eb3d9d5f95.jpg","image_width":280,"title":"Egg and Spoon Set","text":"<p>Promotes balance, coordination, and active fun with a 6-piece egg-and-spoon set. Durable plastic eggs “crack” to reveal yolks, making obstacle courses and races safe and engaging for kids.<\/p>","button_label":"Shop Now","button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/toys?variant=40556680413313"}},"text_block_nYr9nR":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/PHBRS-Skip-Ball-Set-800x1000px_6e0e46cd-4ec8-45d7-a853-6fa0e957b850.jpg","image_width":280,"title":"Skip Ball Set","text":"<p>Fun coordination and cardio activity for kids. Swing the 18\" cord with the 5.5\" ankle ring to get the ball moving — perfect for playful movement and skill-building.<\/p>","button_label":"Shop Now","button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/toys?variant=40556680380545"}}},"block_order":["text_block_hf78Mk","text_block_4pPhcn","text_block_9ipmMz","text_block_MQ9bdF","text_block_nYr9nR"],"name":"Balance & Movement","settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"text_columns_VCqYrF":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"text_block_eFYiVi":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/J50-Balance-MoonHopper-800x1000px_2c1fae19-062a-441c-942e-8365461e110e.jpg","image_width":280,"title":"Moon Hopper","text":"<p>Improve balance and lower-body strength with this sturdy balance trainer. Features a 7\" vinyl ball in a 15\" ABS ring with burst-proof construction for safety. Supp